{"id": "sc3-01-001", "domain": "farm scene", "names": [], "groups": {}, "text": "Let's draw a farm. Start with a pale cyan rectangle as the sky background, 780 wide and 250 tall, centred at 400,135, and call it Sky.", "wires": [{"span": "Start with a pale cyan rectangle as the sky background, 780 wide and 250 tall, centred at 400,135, and call it Sky", "trigger": "Start with", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "rectangle", "color": "cyan", "fill": "light", "layer": "background", "width": "780", "height": "250", "at": "400,135", "name": "Sky"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-002", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky"], "groups": {}, "text": "Now the grass: a light green rectangle zone named Grass, 780 by 230, at 400,375.", "wires": [{"span": "a light green rectangle zone named Grass, 780 by 230, at 400,375", "trigger": "rectangle", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "rectangle", "color": "green", "fill": "light", "layer": "zone", "name": "Grass", "width": "780", "height": "230", "at": "400,375"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-003", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass"], "groups": {}, "text": "Put a large gold circle in the top right for the sun and name it Sun.", "wires": [{"span": "Put a large gold circle in the top right for the sun and name it Sun", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "size": "large", "color": "gold", "position": "topRight", "name": "Sun"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-004", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Sun"], "groups": {}, "text": "huge red square at 170,330, call it Walls", "wires": [{"span": "huge red square at 170,330, call it Walls", "trigger": "square", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "size": "huge", "color": "red", "shape": "square", "at": "170,330", "name": "Walls"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-005", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Sun", "Walls"], "groups": {}, "text": "Next a huge brown triangle named Roof at 170,204, that's the barn roof.", "wires": [{"span": "a huge brown triangle named Roof at 170,204", "trigger": "triangle", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "size": "huge", "color": "brown", "shape": "triangle", "name": "Roof", "at": "170,204"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-006", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof"], "groups": {}, "text": "small navy rectangle for the door at 170,362, named Door", "wires": [{"span": "small navy rectangle for the door at 170,362, named Door", "trigger": "rectangle", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "size": "small", "color": "navy", "shape": "rectangle", "at": "170,362", "name": "Door"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-007", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "groups": {}, "text": "Write \"BARN\" on the roof please", "wires": [{"span": "Write \"BARN\" on the roof", "trigger": "Write", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "label", "target": "Roof", "label": "BARN"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-008", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "groups": {}, "text": "group Walls, Roof and Door as Barn", "wires": [{"span": "group Walls, Roof and Door as Barn", "trigger": "group", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Walls,Roof,Door", "name": "Barn"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-009", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"]}, "text": "Next to the barn I want a silo: a gray rectangle 50 wide and 150 tall, called Silo, right of Barn.", "wires": [{"span": "I want a silo: a gray rectangle 50 wide and 150 tall, called Silo, right of Barn", "trigger": "want", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "rectangle", "color": "gray", "width": "50", "height": "150", "name": "Silo", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Barn"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-010", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"]}, "text": "Could you add a small gray circle named Dome 10 px above Silo?", "wires": [{"span": "add a small gray circle named Dome 10 px above Silo", "trigger": "add", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "size": "small", "color": "gray", "shape": "circle", "name": "Dome", "distance": "10", "position": "above", "anchor": "Silo"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-011", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"]}, "text": "how many rectangles are there now?", "wires": [{"span": "how many rectangles are there now", "trigger": "how many", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "shape": "rectangle"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-012", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"]}, "text": "Time for the cow. Big white oval with a black outline at 480,370, name it Cow.", "wires": [{"span": "Big white oval with a black outline at 480,370, name it Cow", "trigger": "oval", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "size": "large", "color": "white", "shape": "ellipse", "outline": "black", "at": "480,370", "name": "Cow"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-013", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"]}, "text": "and a small white circle for its head at 566,340, call that one CowHead", "wires": [{"span": "a small white circle for its head at 566,340, call that one CowHead", "trigger": "circle", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "size": "small", "color": "white", "shape": "circle", "at": "566,340", "name": "CowHead"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-014", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"]}, "text": "Put a tiny black circle named Spot1 at 455,355 and another tiny black circle, Spot2, at 505,385.", "wires": [{"span": "Put a tiny black circle named Spot1 at 455,355", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "size": "tiny", "color": "black", "shape": "circle", "name": "Spot1", "at": "455,355"}}, {"span": "another tiny black circle, Spot2, at 505,385", "trigger": "another tiny black circle", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "size": "tiny", "color": "black", "shape": "circle", "name": "Spot2", "at": "505,385"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-015", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"]}, "text": "bundle Cow, CowHead, Spot1 and Spot2 into a group called Bessie", "wires": [{"span": "bundle Cow, CowHead, Spot1 and Spot2 into a group called Bessie", "trigger": "bundle", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Cow,CowHead,Spot1,Spot2", "name": "Bessie"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-016", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"]}, "text": "shift Bessie 30 pixels to the left", "wires": [{"span": "shift Bessie 30 pixels to the left", "trigger": "shift", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Bessie", "direction": "left", "distance": "30"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-017", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"]}, "text": "Add a light blue ellipse zone called Pond in the bottom right, 170 by 70.", "wires": [{"span": "Add a light blue ellipse zone called Pond in the bottom right, 170 by 70", "trigger": "Add", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "color": "blue", "fill": "light", "shape": "ellipse", "layer": "zone", "name": "Pond", "position": "bottomRight", "width": "170", "height": "70"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-018", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Pond", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"]}, "text": "tiny yellow circle named Duck at 690,425", "wires": [{"span": "tiny yellow circle named Duck at 690,425", "trigger": "circle", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "size": "tiny", "color": "yellow", "shape": "circle", "name": "Duck", "at": "690,425"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-019", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Pond", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2", "Duck"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"]}, "text": "Its beak: a tiny orange triangle at 712,422. Call it Beak.", "wires": [{"span": "a tiny orange triangle at 712,422. Call it Beak", "trigger": "triangle", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "size": "tiny", "color": "orange", "shape": "triangle", "at": "712,422", "name": "Beak"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-020", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Pond", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2", "Duck", "Beak"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"]}, "text": "Group the duck and its beak as Ducky.", "wires": [{"span": "Group the duck and its beak as Ducky", "trigger": "Group", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Duck,Beak", "name": "Ducky"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-021", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Pond", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2", "Duck", "Beak"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"], "Ducky": ["Duck", "Beak"]}, "text": "There's a tree on the far left too, a large green circle at 55,215 called Leaves.", "wires": [{"span": "a large green circle at 55,215 called Leaves", "trigger": "circle", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "size": "large", "color": "green", "shape": "circle", "at": "55,215", "name": "Leaves"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-022", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Pond", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2", "Duck", "Beak", "Leaves"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"], "Ducky": ["Duck", "Beak"]}, "text": "Trunk goes at 55,285: small brown rectangle, name Trunk.", "wires": [{"span": "Trunk goes at 55,285: small brown rectangle, name Trunk", "trigger": "goes", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "at": "55,285", "size": "small", "color": "brown", "shape": "rectangle", "name": "Trunk"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-023", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Pond", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2", "Duck", "Beak", "Leaves", "Trunk"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"], "Ducky": ["Duck", "Beak"]}, "text": "Let's make Leaves and Trunk one group, TreeA.", "wires": [{"span": "Let's make Leaves and Trunk one group, TreeA", "trigger": "one group", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Leaves,Trunk", "name": "TreeA"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-024", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Pond", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2", "Duck", "Beak", "Leaves", "Trunk"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"], "Ducky": ["Duck", "Beak"], "TreeA": ["Leaves", "Trunk"]}, "text": "white oval cloud in the sky at 330,70, name it Cloud", "wires": [{"span": "white oval cloud in the sky at 330,70, name it Cloud", "trigger": "oval", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "color": "white", "shape": "ellipse", "at": "330,70", "name": "Cloud"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-025", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Pond", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2", "Duck", "Beak", "Leaves", "Trunk", "Cloud"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"], "Ducky": ["Duck", "Beak"], "TreeA": ["Leaves", "Trunk"]}, "text": "duplicate Cloud", "wires": [{"span": "duplicate Cloud", "trigger": "duplicate", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Cloud"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-026", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Pond", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2", "Duck", "Beak", "Leaves", "Trunk", "Cloud", "ellipse1"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"], "Ducky": ["Duck", "Beak"], "TreeA": ["Leaves", "Trunk"]}, "text": "move the copy up by 15", "wires": [{"span": "move the copy up by 15", "trigger": "move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "ellipse1", "direction": "up", "distance": "15"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-027", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Pond", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2", "Duck", "Beak", "Leaves", "Trunk", "Cloud", "ellipse1"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"], "Ducky": ["Duck", "Beak"], "TreeA": ["Leaves", "Trunk"]}, "text": "rename it Cloud2", "wires": [{"span": "rename it Cloud2", "trigger": "rename", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "ellipse1", "name": "Cloud2"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-028", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Pond", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2", "Duck", "Beak", "Leaves", "Trunk", "Cloud", "Cloud2"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"], "Ducky": ["Duck", "Beak"], "TreeA": ["Leaves", "Trunk"]}, "text": "Along the bottom left, five tiny brown squares in a row for the fence.", "wires": [{"span": "Along the bottom left, five tiny brown squares in a row", "trigger": "squares", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "position": "bottomLeft", "count": "5", "size": "tiny", "color": "brown", "shape": "square", "layout": "row"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-029", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Pond", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2", "Duck", "Beak", "Leaves", "Trunk", "Cloud", "Cloud2", "square1", "square2", "square3", "square4", "square5"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"], "Ducky": ["Duck", "Beak"], "TreeA": ["Leaves", "Trunk"]}, "text": "join them in a chain with plain brown lines", "wires": [{"span": "join them in a chain with plain brown lines", "trigger": "join", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "square1,square2,square3,square4,square5", "pairing": "chain", "arrow": "none", "color": "brown"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-030", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Pond", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2", "Duck", "Beak", "Leaves", "Trunk", "Cloud", "Cloud2", "square1", "square2", "square3", "square4", "square5"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"], "Ducky": ["Duck", "Beak"], "TreeA": ["Leaves", "Trunk"]}, "text": "What colour is the roof?", "wires": [{"span": "What colour is the roof", "trigger": "What colour", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Roof", "property": "color"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-031", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Pond", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2", "Duck", "Beak", "Leaves", "Trunk", "Cloud", "Cloud2", "square1", "square2", "square3", "square4", "square5"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"], "Ducky": ["Duck", "Beak"], "TreeA": ["Leaves", "Trunk"]}, "text": "Hmm, change the roof to gray, red and brown together look odd.", "wires": [{"span": "change the roof to gray", "trigger": "change", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Roof", "color": "gray"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-032", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Pond", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2", "Duck", "Beak", "Leaves", "Trunk", "Cloud", "Cloud2", "square1", "square2", "square3", "square4", "square5"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"], "Ducky": ["Duck", "Beak"], "TreeA": ["Leaves", "Trunk"]}, "text": "drag Cloud2 to 660,95 so it covers part of the sun", "wires": [{"span": "drag Cloud2 to 660,95", "trigger": "drag", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Cloud2", "at": "660,95"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-033", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Pond", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2", "Duck", "Beak", "Leaves", "Trunk", "Cloud", "Cloud2", "square1", "square2", "square3", "square4", "square5"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"], "Ducky": ["Duck", "Beak"], "TreeA": ["Leaves", "Trunk"]}, "text": "bring Cloud2 to the front", "wires": [{"span": "bring Cloud2 to the front", "trigger": "bring", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "toFront", "target": "Cloud2"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-034", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Pond", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2", "Duck", "Beak", "Leaves", "Trunk", "Cloud", "square1", "square2", "square3", "square4", "square5", "Cloud2"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"], "Ducky": ["Duck", "Beak"], "TreeA": ["Leaves", "Trunk"]}, "text": "Is the sun still right of the barn?", "wires": [{"span": "Is the sun still right of the barn", "trigger": "right of", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Sun", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Barn"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-035", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Pond", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2", "Duck", "Beak", "Leaves", "Trunk", "Cloud", "square1", "square2", "square3", "square4", "square5", "Cloud2"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"], "Ducky": ["Duck", "Beak"], "TreeA": ["Leaves", "Trunk"]}, "text": "I need a hen: small white circle named Hen, below Silo.", "wires": [{"span": "I need a hen: small white circle named Hen, below Silo", "trigger": "need", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "size": "small", "color": "white", "shape": "circle", "name": "Hen", "position": "below", "anchor": "Silo"}}]}
{"id": "sc3-01-036", "domain": "farm scene", "names": ["Sky", "Grass", "Pond", "Sun", "Walls", "Roof", "Door", "Silo", "Dome", "Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2", "Duck", "Beak", "Leaves", "Trunk", "Cloud", "square1", "square2", "square3", "square4", "square5", "Cloud2", "Hen"], "groups": {"Barn": ["Walls", "Roof", "Door"], "Bessie": ["Cow", "CowHead", "Spot1", "Spot2"], "Ducky": ["Duck", "Beak"], "TreeA": ["Leaves", "Trunk"]}, "text": "Hen gets an orange beak too, a tiny orange triangle called HenBeak at 2 o'clock... no, just put it right of Hen, 4 px away.", "wires": [{"span": "Hen gets an orange beak too, a tiny orange triangle called HenBeak at 2 o'clock... no, just put it right of Hen, 4 px away", "trigger": "gets", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "color": "orange", "size": "tiny", "shape": "triangle", "name": "HenBeak", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Hen", "distance": "4"}}]}
